        "quote": "Rule No. 560-X-13-.07 Non-covered Items and Services Non-covered items and services include, but are not limited to: (3) Items for use in hospitals, nursing homes, or other institutions. However, DME items may be provided in nursing homes or other institutions for children through the EPSDT Program."
